# skill: theme-modern

## Contract
- **語義承諾**：深色簡約風格，以深灰（#0f172a）為底、白卡片承載內容、藍色（#3b82f6）為主強調色，精準間距
- **CSS Custom Properties**：
  - `--bg-page: #0f172a` — 頁面背景
  - `--bg-card: #1e293b` — 卡片背景
  - `--bg-input: #0f172a` — 輸入框背景
  - `--border: #334155` — 邊框色
  - `--accent: #3b82f6` — 主強調色（藍）
  - `--accent-hover: #60a5fa` — 強調色懸停態
  - `--danger: #ef4444` — 危險/錯誤色
  - `--success: #22c55e` — 成功色
  - `--warning: #f59e0b` — 警告色
  - `--text-primary: #f8fafc` — 主要文字
  - `--text-secondary: #94a3b8` — 次要文字
  - `--text-muted: #64748b` — 淡化文字

## Dependencies
- **依賴**：無
- **可選依賴**：無
- **排斥**：無

## Slots
無 slots（主題是全域 CSS，無注入點）

## Boundaries
- **系統邊界**：Presentation Layer
- **操作邊界**：
  - ✅ 操作：全域 CSS 樣式定義、DOM 元素覆寫
  - ❌ 不操作：JavaScript 邏輯、狀態管理、網路請求

## Examples
```css
/* 套用到頁面 */
body { background: var(--bg-page); color: var(--text-primary); }
/* 卡片元件 */
background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--border);
/* 主要操作 */
background: var(--accent);
/* 危險操作 */
color: var(--danger);
```

[style]
@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+TC:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap');

:root {
  --bg-page: #0f172a;
  --bg-card: #1e293b;
  --bg-input: #0f172a;
  --border: #334155;
  --accent: #3b82f6;
  --accent-hover: #60a5fa;
  --danger: #ef4444;
  --success: #22c55e;
  --warning: #f59e0b;
  --text-primary: #f8fafc;
  --text-secondary: #94a3b8;
  --text-muted: #64748b;
}

*, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

body {
  font-family: 'Noto Sans TC', 'Inter', sans-serif;
  background: var(--bg-page);
  color: var(--text-primary);
  min-height: 100vh;
  line-height: 1.6;
}

.warehouse-header {
  background: var(--bg-card) !important;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border) !important;
  padding: 20px 32px !important;
}
.header-title { font-size: 20px !important; font-weight: 700 !important; }

.btn-primary {
  background: var(--accent) !important;
  border: none !important;
  border-radius: 8px !important;
  padding: 9px 18px !important;
  font-weight: 600 !important;
  font-size: 14px !important;
  transition: background 0.15s ease !important;
}
.btn-primary:hover { background: var(--accent-hover) !important; }

.btn-edit {
  border: 1px solid var(--border) !important;
  background: transparent !important;
  color: var(--text-secondary) !important;
  border-radius: 6px !important;
  font-size: 13px !important;
  transition: all 0.15s ease !important;
}
.btn-edit:hover { border-color: var(--accent) !important; color: var(--accent) !important; }

.btn-delete {
  border: 1px solid rgba(239,68,68,0.3) !important;
  background: transparent !important;
  color: var(--danger) !important;
  border-radius: 6px !important;
  font-size: 13px !important;
  transition: all 0.15s ease !important;
}
.btn-delete:hover { background: rgba(239,68,68,0.1) !important; border-color: var(--danger) !important; }

.inventory-table { border-collapse: collapse !important; }
.inventory-table th {
  background: transparent !important;
  color: var(--text-muted) !important;
  font-size: 12px !important;
  font-weight: 600 !important;
  text-transform: uppercase !important;
  letter-spacing: 0.5px !important;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border) !important;
  padding: 12px 16px !important;
}
.inventory-table td {
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border) !important;
  padding: 14px 16px !important;
  font-size: 14px !important;
}
.inventory-table tr:hover td { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02) !important; }

.toolbar {
  background: transparent !important;
  border: none !important;
  padding: 20px 32px !important;
}
.search-box input {
  background: var(--bg-card) !important;
  border: 1px solid var(--border) !important;
  border-radius: 8px !important;
  color: var(--text-primary) !important;
  padding: 9px 14px !important;
  font-size: 14px !important;
  width: 260px !important;
  transition: border-color 0.15s ease !important;
}
.search-box input:focus { border-color: var(--accent) !important; outline: none !important; }
.search-box input::placeholder { color: var(--text-muted) !important; }
.filter-group select {
  background: var(--bg-card) !important;
  border: 1px solid var(--border) !important;
  border-radius: 8px !important;
  color: var(--text-primary) !important;
  padding: 9px 14px !important;
  font-size: 14px !important;
  cursor: pointer !important;
}
.filter-group select option { background: var(--bg-card); }
.filter-group select:focus { border-color: var(--accent) !important; outline: none !important; }

.badge { padding: 3px 10px !important; border-radius: 20px !important; font-size: 12px !important; font-weight: 500 !important; }
.badge-ok { background: rgba(34,197,94,0.12) !important; color: var(--success) !important; }
.badge-warning { background: rgba(245,158,11,0.12) !important; color: var(--warning) !important; }
.badge-danger { background: rgba(239,68,68,0.12) !important; color: var(--danger) !important; }

.category-tag { padding: 3px 10px !important; border-radius: 20px !important; font-size: 12px !important; }
.cat-electronics { background: rgba(59,130,246,0.12) !important; color: #60a5fa !important; }
.cat-tools { background: rgba(245,158,11,0.12) !important; color: #fbbf24 !important; }
.cat-materials { background: rgba(34,197,94,0.12) !important; color: var(--success) !important; }
.cat-packaging { background: rgba(168,85,247,0.12) !important; color: #c084fc !important; }
